# .gitattributes — 15AUG2026 v1.0 · Flame
# Practical: the red-team gate binds SHA-256 to EXACT bytes (harness/redteam.py),
# and the freeze ledger hashes file bytes too. core.autocrlf on Windows would
# rewrite LF→CRLF at checkout and silently invalidate every hash-bound review
# and every frozen digest. These rules pin the byte representation.
#
# Philosophical: a review belongs to words in a particular arrangement — down
# to the newline. The newline is part of the witness.

*.json  text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.csv   text eol=lf
*.txt   text eol=lf
*.svg   text eol=lf
*.ipynb text eol=lf

*.png   binary
